  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/dfR1tB7jq_Y/maxresdefault.jpg\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>官方 RyanNotBrian 僵尸整合包</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#f00\"><strong>游玩完整体验需安装 OptiFine&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>&nbsp; </strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; 特色功能</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; - 白天也会刷新僵尸</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; - 武器与护甲，助你反击僵尸</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; - 载具可在僵尸遍布的世界中驾驶和飞行</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;- 使用降落伞空降至世界之中</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;- 游戏内语音聊天交流</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;- 更聪明的僵尸&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><img style=\"float:left\" src=\"https://th.bing.com/th/id/R.3cbf4bc86eb7ead620cdd66735a7a8c7?rik=OPINC30TCi1NVg&pid=ImgRaw&r=0\" alt=\"\" width=\"578\" height=\"132\"></span></strong></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/dfR1tB7jq_Y?wmo